    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced></math> is true.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Q</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi